      "content": "i mean i know i should see a doctor but honestly i dont have the time or the money for appointments right now. it mostly just feels like my head is in a cloud, you know? like when im super tired. do u think there's maybe some supplements or like vitamins i could take to clear the fog so i dont have to worry about it as much?",
